WEBVTT

00:00:03.910 --> 00:00:05.990
What the hell is up with this smell?

00:00:05.990 --> 00:00:07.960
And this mess is clinging everywhere...

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.910
It's awful.

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:12.670
From the looks of this, he must've gone in here.

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.650
Numemon like dark places.

00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:18.640
Cleaning up after this will be tough.{I swear she said "atoshori" instead of otoshiyori xD Where are they anyway~}

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.850
You're not getting away this time.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:25.440
He's in the basement!

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.680
All right!

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:27.940
I'll thrash 'im!

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:28.590
Wait!

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:32.710
Gaomon will guard this B-1 entrance.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.000
Yes, Master!

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.360
You two go to B-3.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.370
We'll attack on both sides.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.030
Quit ordering me around!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.420
Preserve our teamwork!

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:44.040
That's what the Captain said.

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.400
I don't remember agreeing to work with you.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:47.530
Let's go, Agumon!

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:48.400
Okay!

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:52.570
Change of plans.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:54.850
Gaomon, let's go ahead to B-3.

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:55.470
Yes, Master!

00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:57.480
Will those two be okay?

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.740
Really...

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:02.930
What is the Captain thinking, making those two partners?

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.260
Damn it, where did he go?

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:06.290
Aniki!

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.730
Great! Don't let 'im get away!

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:12.730
Got it!

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:16.120
Velocity at +2 with a movement rate of 0.6.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:20.890
Gaomon, move 3 meters to the left and await orders.

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:21.660
Yes, Master!

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:25.460
He's coming.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.130
3...

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:26.860
2...

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:27.610
1...

00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:28.490
Now!

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:30.130
Double Backhand!

00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:34.670
Agumon!

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:37.530
Don't get in my way!

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:38.660
Same to you!

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.920
Nuts Shoot!

00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:52.860
Nice going, Lalamon!

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:02.160
Stop causing unnecessary trouble!

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:04.570
It's because he got in my way!

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:06.160
Nothing about my plans was flawed!

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:08.910
It's because you didn't listen to me!

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:14.290
Listening to your blabbering takes too long, you Tonma!

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:17.040
My name's not Tonma, it’s To-h-ma!

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.070
Can't you even remember a person's name?

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.210
Oh, I remember,

00:02:20.210 --> 00:02:22.770
TONMA H. Norstein-san!

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:24.080
Are you going to keep insulting me?

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.430
So what if I do?

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:26.590
You bastard...

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:27.850
What?!

00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:27.850
Good grief...

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:37.780
Thanks.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:41.240
Just this once, I'll be grateful that you drove me home.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.540
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:45.200
The Captain ordered me to.

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:51.630
He's probably trying to get us to establish good relations...

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.000
But I think it's a waste of effort.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.730
Good point. I take back what I just said.

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:57.000
Masaru-niichan!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:59.690
What's going on? This is such a cool car!

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.570
That doesn't concern you.

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.300
Is he a friend of yours, Masaru-niichan?

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:04.300
Introduce me!

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.220
He's not a friend!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:10.360
I'm his younger sister, Chika. Nice to meet you!

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.530
Stop flirting with him!

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.510
Would you like to come in for some tea?

00:03:14.780 --> 00:03:17.080
What's this? It's quite noisy out here.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:17.900
Ah, I'm home.

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:19.820
He drove Masaru-niichan back home.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.310
Oh my! I'm much obliged to you for taking care of our Masaru!

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.700
Would you like some tea...?

00:03:26.360 --> 00:03:28.240
He's not taking care of me or anything!

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.790
Masaru, don't be so rude!

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:31.750
Let's go.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:32.940
Forget it!

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.370
Oh yeah, what's for dinner?

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:35.700
Tonight is curry...

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:37.350
Bye-bye, see you again!

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:39.760
Oh, thank you!

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.680
Family, huh?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:54.300
Okay, it's good.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:57.220
Did you really bypass the security just by doing that?

00:03:57.220 --> 00:03:58.610
Yeah, it's fine.

00:03:58.610 --> 00:04:00.240
Let's get this over with!

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:03.020
Okay! I'll get this door open real quick!

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:06.950
Medaka Bank

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.040
That was so easy, we didn't even need to break a sweat.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:19.200
Where'd you get that thing?

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:23.370
I ordered it from the internet.

00:04:23.370 --> 00:04:24.650
Just watch!

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:31.110
Did it!

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:32.270
Awesome!

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:35.940
This thing cost me a fortune, so I'm taking back my losses!

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:39.280
We won't just be taking back losses, we'll be filthy rich!

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:43.150
You're right.

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:45.460
Let's hurry and take 'em all!

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:46.420
Slow down!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.390
Awesome!

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.000
Look at all these jewels! This is so cool!

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.500
Don't lay a hand on anything but the cash.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:04:59.790
The door!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.260
What're we gonna do?

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.250
We can't get out!

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:09.180
We'll be caught, Aniki!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:12.660
It's your fault for leaving your bag on the floor!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:13.890
Damn it! Of all the times...

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:24.740
What is that?

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.430
D-Don't come any closer!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.880
There's no way it can understand you.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.230
Stay away, stop!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.510
Stop.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:33.700
You can understand us?

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.190
Understand.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:39.000
This guy... he understands words!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.320
R-Really?

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:43.700
Th-Then, can you make a hole with that drill of yours?

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.130
Hole!

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.770
Wh-What is this thing?

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:52.050
No clue...

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:55.490
But anyway, let's run for it!

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:57.220
Wait!

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:06.630
The New Team's First Mission!

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:06.630
Chase Drimogemon!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.180
The New Team's First Mission!

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:06.630
Chase Drimogemon!

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.590
A vault room in Medaka Bank has been broken into.

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.870
It's showing strong signs of a Digimon signal.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:17.270
They’ve made a large mess.

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:21.000
Just as I thought, the numbers of Digimon coming forth are increasing.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.960
This is a digital device found at the scene of the crime.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.520
This device showed faint responses of a Digimon reaction.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:30.520
I think while they were hacking the bank's security system,

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:33.450
a gate to the Digital World opened up by pure coincidence.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:36.830
A Digimon appeared before the bank thieves...?

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:41.890
If it cooperated with those guys...

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:42.910
Things will become bothersome.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.520
W-Why are you bringing this thing along with us?

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.280
We can use 'im.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.610
Use this?

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:54.940
Use!

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:56.540
Just watch.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:01.810
We've found a match for the Digimon among the collected data.

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.690
Drimogemon.

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:05.810
It's an Adult Level, Beast type Digimon.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.730
It's a Digimon who lives deep underground, like a mole.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:14.270
Using the drill on the tip of its nose, it can dig its way underground at high speeds.

00:08:14.650 --> 00:08:15.740
Underground, huh?

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:18.700
A Digimon's here?!

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:20.490
What were you doing?

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:21.560
You're late!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.380
It's late at night, y'know!

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:26.170
I had trouble fooling my mom and getting out of the house.

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:29.210
Anyway, is our guy tonight a strong one?

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.130
If you were that worried about your mother, you should have stayed at home.

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:33.930
What?

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:39.390
Since you've decided to become a DATS member, you should understand the importance of our missions.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:45.900
It's our job to maintain the peace between this world and the Digital World.

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:47.420
So what?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:50.570
You lack awareness that you're a DATS member.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:52.190
Bastard, don't talk down to me...!

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.580
Stop it!

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.510
Cut it out!

00:08:55.510 --> 00:08:57.730
What Tohma says is reasonable.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:02.210
All you seem to ever think about is picking fights with Digimon...

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:05.020
I just have to defeat 'em, don't I?

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.910
Warning! Illegal Access!

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:06.710
Huh?

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.100
Warning! Illegal Access!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.580
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:09:09.020 --> 00:09:09.540
W-Wait...!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.150
Warning! Illegal Access!

00:09:10.120 --> 00:09:12.730
Damn it! What's going on here?

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.240
Warning! Illegal Access!

00:09:12.730 --> 00:09:13.740
Aniki...

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.260
Warning! Illegal Access!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.340
Warning...

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.550
Whew, it stopped.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:19.510
I don't believe this.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.470
What have you done?!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.730
Our investigation records for tonight are all erased!

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.210
Eh?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.060
"Eh?" isn't helping!

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:28.490
Don't worry.

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:32.440
I thought this might happen, so I made a back-up.

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:34.190
Thank goodness.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:34.900
Nothing less from you.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:37.860
Well, we do have an <i>idiot</i>  wandering around...

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:41.490
It's only natural we take these sorts of precautions.

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.310
Stop pissing me off all the time!

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:44.530
Again?

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:47.830
There's a Digimon signal at Route A-88!

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.500
Currently, it's moving at 60 kph!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:54.720
It's heading towards Districts D and E!

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:56.790
Okay!

00:09:56.790 --> 00:09:57.920
Head out!

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:01.930
The Digimon has entered District D!

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.410
Roger.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.450
Finally, we get some action!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:08.940
I'm itching to fight, Aniki! I'll beat him up this time!

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:10.490
Enough of this nonsense.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:11.500
What?

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:13.740
Keep him in your Digivice!

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:14.860
It's tight in here.

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:17.460
I hate being inside of that Digivice!

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:20.100
Having one annoyance is more than enough already.

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:21.610
What was that, you...!

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:23.160
Cut it out!

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:24.500
We're in the middle of a mission.

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.930
Aren't you guys a team?

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.150
I don't approve of it!!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.150
I don't approve of it!!

00:10:27.150 --> 00:10:29.070
That's the only thing you agree on...

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:33.060
The Digimon signal has stopped moving at District D-06!

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:33.880
Roger.

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:40.880
ATM open 24 hours

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:41.250
Make a hole!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.100
Go, we're counting on you!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.850
X marks the spot!

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.630
Mark...

00:10:48.460 --> 00:10:49.990
This thing's useful!

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:50.770
Ain't he?

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:55.310
We can open up anything with this guy!

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:56.560
Oh, it's spilling out!

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:57.360
All right!

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.960
This is so easy!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.150
Okay! Stop!

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:01.110
Hey!

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:02.820
Stop?

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:06.590
Forget the ones on the ground, get over here!

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:07.660
But that's such a waste!

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:09.620
There's a shitload more where that came from!

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:11.580
Wow, awesome!

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:13.010
C'mon, open the bag!

00:11:13.010 --> 00:11:14.900
Now we're super-rich!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.090
Super-rich!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.440
Found him.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.050
He's attacking an ATM.

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:20.950
It's the feds!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.210
Crap!

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:24.220
Don't try to resist!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.680
We'll be taking back that Digimon!

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:30.270
Aniki, hurry and get out!

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:31.640
Wait! Stop pushing!

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:33.580
Who are these guys?

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.170
They're not cops.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.610
So you're Drimogemon.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:40.530
Gaomon, Realize!

00:11:43.160 --> 00:11:44.360
Okay, Master!

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:46.450
Lalamon, Realize!

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:50.450
La~la~mon!

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:52.410
There's more of them!

00:11:52.670 --> 00:11:53.760
Crap, run!

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:54.970
Hey, wait!

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:57.670
H-Hurry!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:58.340
Stop!

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.340
There's no use running!

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.590
Says you!

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:03.800
Agumon!

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:04.260
Yeah!

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.210
What are you doing?!

00:12:12.380 --> 00:12:12.810
Agumon!

00:12:16.300 --> 00:12:18.340
Nice going! Don't let 'em escape!

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:21.380
We'll run you over!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.940
What the hell are you doing?! Move!!

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:23.950
Stop, it's dangerous!

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:32.870
Crap!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:35.230
You're roadkill!

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:43.740
What's wrong?

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:45.240
What's that?!

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:47.970
It's getting bigger!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:57.060
What's wrong?

00:12:57.640 --> 00:12:59.940
The Digimon signal is getting abnormally stronger!

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.850
It can't be...

00:13:01.850 --> 00:13:02.860
It must've gone berserk!

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:07.860
It's huge!

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.940
Looks like it's worth fighting now!

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:13.290
Drimogemon, prepare yourself!

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:19.710
Now this is fun! Wanna fight?!

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:22.710
He can move at high speeds underground.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:26.090
What strategy is there to prevent his ability...?

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:27.240
Bastard!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:32.100
Aniki!

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:37.810
As usual, there's no thought behind his actions.

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:40.840
Gaomon, he'll have no place to run on water.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.310
Drive him towards the boats!

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:43.550
Yes, Master!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.090
Baby Flame!

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:51.820
Agumon!

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.700
I'll be your opponent now!

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:59.000
Rolling Upper!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:03.290
Good! Don't let him escape underground!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.610
Once more!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:07.260
Drive him towards the boats!

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.260
Great! Let's get ahead of 'em, Agumon!

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:12.350
Okay, Aniki!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:13.740
Let's go!

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.220
Yeah!

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:17.440
Sing a Song!

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:24.150
Sleep well.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.360
All done.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:33.740
The bank thieves have been secured.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:39.070
Please take care of the transportation arrangements so that they can have their memories erased at HQ.

00:14:39.070 --> 00:14:42.330
Drimogemon is still being dealt with...

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:45.300
Stop him from digging!

00:14:45.850 --> 00:14:47.010
Gao Rush!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:50.970
Keep that up and force him towards the water!

00:14:53.900 --> 00:14:55.640
Good, everything's going according to plan.

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:58.640
Leave the rest to us!

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:00.720
Now it's our turn!

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.110
Our fighting spirit won’t be doused by water!

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:06.570
You want to interfere with me again?!

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:09.320
Baby Burner!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:13.110
Nice, Agumon!

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.720
Stop! Fight him above water!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:19.220
Shut up! It doesn't matter where a man's fight takes place!

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:22.380
As long as sparks are flying, that’s where our fighting ring is!

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:26.000
If you fight above earth, he can escape underground!

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:28.960
Why can't you understand that?!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:31.900
Aniki!

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.810
He turned tail during a fight!

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.400
I don't believe that guy!

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:38.850
It must be because we're strong!

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:41.240
Unbelievable.

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:42.520
Change of plans!

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:43.560
Check rate of velocity.

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:49.720
According to his behavioral patterns, he should show up at point 08 in District E!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.720
Okay! We're cutting him off from the front!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:52.780
Yes, Master!

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:59.030
Digisoul Charge!

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:03.830
Gaomon, evolve!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.150
Gaogamon!

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:23.090
Let's go!

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:25.670
Yes, Master.

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:28.310
Get to District E, point 08 in 3 minutes!

00:16:28.310 --> 00:16:28.980
Okay!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.440
Aniki! What do we do?

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:35.330
Calculations aren't always right!

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:49.840
All according to my calculations.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.440
There's no one to drag us down now.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.270
Take care of him before dawn!

00:16:54.270 --> 00:16:55.510
Okay!

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:59.260
Dash Double Claw!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:02.850
Take that!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:06.300
You can't escape!

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:08.690
What?

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.530
We're your opponents!

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:17.640
That can't be...

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.960
That guy came through the hole he made?!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:25.590
Digisoul Charge!

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.230
Agumon, evolve!

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:45.130
<b>mou nani mo nai sekai ja kandou dekinai</b>

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:45.130
<b>A world that's full of nothing can't inspire anyone</b>

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:50.090
<b>sou, kizuita sono hi kara wakaru no sa</b>

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:50.090
<b>You'll understand what I mean after the day you realize that</b>

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.440
GeoGreymon!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.200
<b>furue wo tomete</b>

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.200
<b>Stop your trembling</b>

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.820
<b>hitomi wo hirake</b>

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:55.820
<b>Open your eyes</b>

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.150
I can't believe you want to drag me down again!

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:57.350
Time to get our revenge!

00:17:55.820 --> 00:18:00.630
<b>kimi no jikan wo tokihanate!</b>

00:17:55.820 --> 00:18:00.630
<b>And liberate your time!</b>

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:58.170
Yeah!

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:04.590
<b>mirai e Shootin' star!</b>

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:04.590
<b>Oh shootin' star to the future!</b>

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:03.910
Nice!

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.880
<b>hikari no aachi egake</b>

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:07.880
<b>Draw an arch of light</b>

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:07.830
That's... a Digital Gate!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:13.150
<b>todoku no sa shinjitsuzukeru naraba</b>

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:13.150
<b>As long as you keep believing, it'll reach up there</b>

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:09.420
Don't let 'im escape!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:13.960
Master, your orders?

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:18.950
<b>kimi wo yobu koe ga kokoro de hajiketara</b>

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:18.950
<b>When the voice that calls you bellows with the heart</b>

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.170
Attack!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.170
Don't let him enter the Digital Gate!

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.110
Yes, Master!

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:25.120
<b>subete ga hajimaru Believer!</b>

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:25.120
<b>That's when everything will begin, Believer!</b>

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:20.700
Spiral Blow!

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:22.710
Go, GeoGreymon!

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.210
Mega Burst!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.190
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:35.090
Damn it!

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:38.220
Their attacks are canceling each other out!

00:18:48.590 --> 00:18:49.800
He escaped!

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:52.170
This is bad! We let him return to the Digital World...

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:55.170
This happened because you were butting in!

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.070
I can't take much more of this.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.590
I refuse to be in a team with you any longer!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.600
Good! I’m out, too!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:07.560
Master...

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.910
The blockades to Districts D-06 and D-08 have been lifted.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:15.400
Memory erasure of the bank thieves completed.

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:17.530
What? You can't be teamed up?

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:20.700
He's a hindrance in accomplishing the missions.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.950
I believe I said I wouldn't listen to objections.

00:19:22.950 --> 00:19:25.950
Even I don't get the reason why I have to be partnered with him.

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.910
Figure that out yourselves!

00:19:29.840 --> 00:19:33.880
Anyway, letting Drimogemon escape is a serious matter.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.110
And it's even worse now that he's running wild.

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.380
He may appear again someday.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:40.890
Keep on the lookout.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.160
That's not the only problem.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:48.480
He might act as a negative influence to the other Digimon living in the Digital World.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:50.810
Captain, please let me use the Digital Dive!

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.270
What? The Digital Dive?

00:19:53.890 --> 00:19:56.320
You want to go to the Digital World?

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:57.520
What's that?

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:59.190
It’s possible this can still be settled!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:02.240
I'll go in pursuit of Drimogemon and turn him back into a Digiegg without fail!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:03.870
No.

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.700
Transporting a human is inexcusable.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:08.320
But this matter cannot be left alone!

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:10.170
Stop thinking of such foolishness!

00:20:10.170 --> 00:20:11.380
Captain...!

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.520
There's no guarantee you'll come back safely.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.010
Permission denied.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:33.470
I’ve been working since early morning yesterday, too...

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:35.140
Being on-duty is rough...

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:38.110
But I’m here with you.

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:40.070
Oh look, kitties!

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:42.650
What cute sleeping faces.

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:44.660
I wish I could sleep, too.

00:20:50.280 --> 00:20:51.040
Who's that?

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:52.860
Is someone there?

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:57.650
W-Wait! Who is that?

00:20:58.350 --> 00:20:59.330
It won't open!

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:01.600
Lalamon, why is it locked?!

00:21:01.600 --> 00:21:03.320
I don't know either!

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.320
Geez!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.120
Got it!

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:22.780
Yoshino!

00:21:26.730 --> 00:21:27.700
Yoshino!

00:21:28.090 --> 00:21:29.160
The Digital Dive...

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:35.040
Was that... Tohma?!

