00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:24.330
<b>ENDING THEME 

00:22:36.360 --> 00:22:37.680
Damn that Tohma!

00:22:37.680 --> 00:22:40.690
He left me behind and went to the Digital World by himself!

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:42.530
Agumon, we're going, too!

00:22:42.530 --> 00:22:47.200
Aniki, if we go to the Digital World, Satsuma will get angry at us again!

00:22:47.200 --> 00:22:48.310
I don't care.

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:53.020
Drimogemon is mine! I deal with all my fights on my own!

00:22:53.020 --> 00:22:55.190
That’s what a street fighter does!

00:22:55.190 --> 00:22:56.640
Digimon Savers:

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:58.430
Break into the Digital World!

00:22:58.430 --> 00:22:59.990
Drimogemon’s Trap!

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.480
Awaken in my fist, Digisoul!

00:23:02.170 --> 00:23:05.170
Break into the Digital World!

